# Local harness state stays out; the dev pod (skills, agents) ships with the
# repo — CLAUDE.md names them as the verification method, and a clone that
# lacks them describes a repo that does not exist (docs/adr/0111).
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/agents/

# mindgraph build-time only (Tailwind CLI); the artifact ships no dependencies
mindgraph/node_modules/

# Worker scratch (measurement scripts, never committed)
.scratch/
